    + reflexivity.
    + reflexivity.
    + exact (gso_1RB1LC_0LC0RA_1RA0LD_0RB1LC p j' E).
    + exact (geo_1RB1LC_0LC0RA_1RA0LD_0RB1LC p j' E).
    + lia.
Qed.

