Lemma run_inner_1RB1LC_0LC0RB_1LA1LD_0RA___ : srun tm false true chn_1RB1LC_0LC0RB_1LA1LD_0RA___ AI0_1RB1LC_0LC0RB_1LA1LD_0RA___ = Some (AI1_1RB1LC_0LC0RB_1LA1LD_0RA___, 4, 4).
