    step counts AND exact configurations -- for 192 interior anchors (interior); 6 overflow phases, j = 2..7 (738 inner laps, 3 counts each) (nested overflow).
    Axiom footprint: [functional_extensionality_dep] (via [CTape.lift]). *)
